  "_comment": "SOCOM II (r0004) in-game messages: DME app payload [0x02 class][id][data]. Sent by the game through 0x0032A420(session 0x0045D480, 0x40, *(0x0045D574), target, id, size, data, queue=0); ids are runtime-registered in the table at 0x0044D820 (8-byte stride); receivers are class-2 entries of the DME handler table *(0x00654798) + 0x800. Field layouts come from the sender's stores into its data buffer and the receiver's reads (both listed); 'confirmed' = both sides agree. Names marked '?' are guesses - capture the message in game (socom_server.py capture) and rename. Types: u8 s8 u16 s16 u32 s32 f32 str:N (fixed, NUL-padded) cstr (NUL-terminated, rest of packet) hex (raw bytes, rest of packet).",
